<p begin="00:49:38.960" end="00:49:42.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure you can do this?</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.119" end="00:49:44.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.800" end="00:49:47.559" style="s2">But your father would be furious if I</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.400" end="00:49:47.559" style="s2">didn&#39;t try.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.920" end="00:49:53.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, Dean. Come on. Pick up.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.040" end="00:50:04.720" style="s2">Alex, tell me you&#39;re out of the city.</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.200" end="00:50:07.359" style="s2">Tell me you found something.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.720" end="00:50:10.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We found a plane. I can fly it. Dean,</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.359" end="00:50:12.800" style="s2">we&#39;re coming to Greenland.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.160" end="00:50:15.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. No. Alex, listen to me. Don&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.800" end="00:50:15.800" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.160" end="00:50:18.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Greenland&#39;s full, Alex. They&#39;re turning</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.599" end="00:50:19.359" style="s2">flights away. You&#39;d hold until you&#39;re</p>
