<p begin="00:50:19.359" end="00:50:23.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then where, Dean?</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.680" end="00:50:25.119" style="s2">Africa.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.280" end="00:50:28.839" style="s2">The Congo high hills. High ground old</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.119" end="00:50:28.839" style="s2">rockets. Your only shot.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.040" end="00:50:36.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Africa. Dean, that&#39;s an ocean in this.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.880" end="00:50:38.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One leg at a time. Get south. Find</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.880" end="00:50:43.559" style="s2">something bigger. But you do not come</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.720" end="00:50:43.559" style="s2">north. Promise me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.880" end="00:50:48.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.319" end="00:50:50.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I couldn&#39;t get you a seat anywhere. I</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.800" end="00:50:52.800" style="s2">tried everything.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.480" end="00:50:55.520" style="s2">So run. Get her to that high ground and</p>
