<p begin="00:51:03.200" end="00:51:06.160" style="s2">the world.</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.599" end="00:51:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So we fly south, one field at a time. We</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.160" end="00:51:11.880" style="s2">don&#39;t stop until we&#39;re standing on</p>
