<p begin="00:51:15.119" end="00:51:18.119" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.559" end="00:51:28.680" style="s2">Okay, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.119" end="00:51:40.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. Come on. Turn over.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.720" end="00:51:40.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk to me, Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.359" end="00:51:49.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 200 hours. 200 hours. You&#39;re dead. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.319" end="00:51:49.000" style="s2">let me down. Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.800" end="00:52:15.800" style="s2">Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.040" end="00:52:30.400" style="s2">If we don&#39;t keep fuel at the southern</p>
