<p begin="00:52:51.920" end="00:52:57.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep it open. Quietly. That&#39;s the last</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.079" end="00:52:57.640" style="s2">one I don&#39;t see.</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.200" end="00:53:02.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, what&#39;s happening?</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.599" end="00:53:09.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carb icing. Maybe fuel. Hold on. I&#39;ve</p>
