<p begin="00:53:30.000" end="00:53:36.640" style="s2">That&#39;ll hold. Maybe long enough.</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.280" end="00:53:38.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You keep saying maybe.</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.640" end="00:53:41.319" style="s2">maybe is the most honest word I&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.319" end="00:53:41.319" style="s2">left.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.480" end="00:53:51.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we don&#39;t make it, I&#39;m glad it&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.359" end="00:53:52.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to make it. Then I&#39;m making</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.200" end="00:53:55.737" style="s2">you that dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.880" end="00:53:57.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and that dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.737" end="00:53:57.757" style="s2">[sighs and snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.559" end="00:54:32.800" style="s2">Goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.520" end="00:54:51.800" style="s2">3.8 billion years.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.920" end="00:54:57.800" style="s2">You&#39;ll outlast all of us. You always</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.400" end="00:54:57.800" style="s2">were going to</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.400" end="00:55:17.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.599" end="00:55:20.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it. That&#39;s the one Dean promised.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.119" end="00:55:20.760" style="s2">Hold on. We&#39;re going in.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.440" end="00:55:51.680" style="s2">One leg at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.079" end="00:55:51.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One leg at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.680" end="00:56:02.680" style="s2">Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.440" end="00:56:30.400" style="s2">Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.559" end="00:56:46.880" style="s2">Where&#39;s this bird going? South staging.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.520" end="00:56:47.440" style="s2">Then wherever there&#39;s ground left, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.880" end="00:56:49.040" style="s2">nearly full.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.440" end="00:56:51.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two more. She&#39;s a doctor. I&#39;m fire</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.040" end="00:56:56.359" style="s2">service. We earn the seats.</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.920" end="00:56:56.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A doctor. Get on both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.520" end="00:57:04.400" style="s2">Dean, we made the hub. We&#39;re getting on</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.000" end="00:57:08.119" style="s2">a transport heading south. Tell me</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.400" end="00:57:08.119" style="s2">Africa&#39;s still there.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.480" end="00:57:14.799" style="s2">Tell me Africa&#39;s still there. Congo</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.119" end="00:57:18.000" style="s2">Highlands, the second arc, it&#39;s still</p>
